{"labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le12ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn6le12ob08re2img07.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn6le12ob08re2img07.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmm, this is delicious. The beef is so tender, and the caramelized apples were an unexpected treat!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: I like to keep you on your toes ... You ought to make this recipe for your friends sometime. Plus, stir fries are healthy. I used to make high-fat meals more often than now.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Me, too.  I have changed my eating habits. What is that?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: It's is my trusty spork. It's part of my cutlery collection. It's perfect for this kind of meal.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What! You actually use that thing ... in public?", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn6le12ob08re2img08.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Yes, I bring it with me wherever I go. It's always in my back pocket.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You are so unconventional. You had better not take that to any restaurant with me.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: I do tend to swim against the tide.  Even when I was little, I used to do my own thing and it would irritate my parents.", "time": "39000"}, {"image": "engenn6le12ob08re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sally says you definitely tend to stand out from the crowd.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: I don't want to be just ordinary ... like you.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Don't be rude! You should learn some social etiquette.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: I am what I am ... take it or leave it. What's dessert? Could you look in the fridge?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: A cold shoulder.", "time": "57300"}], "coverimg": "engenn6le12ob08re2img07.jpg"}}], "_data": []}, {"type": "video", "id": 2, "title": "", "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn6le12ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "text": "An Informal Letter <br><br></li><li>Use a casual greeting.\n</li><li>Use informal language.\n</li><li>Use linking words.\n</li><li>End the letter in an informal way.", "time": "0"}]}}], "_data": []}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Vocabulary and Grammar"}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about past habits. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can offer advice and suggestions. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can write about people's behavior and personality. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Do you have good table manners?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What are some poor table manners you have seen?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Writing Spot: Table etiquette with Vanessa and Marco. Is Marco table 